<div class="wrap prose" style="padding-bottom:0">
  <h2>New Zealand tax invoice example</h2>
  <p>A GST-registered designer in Auckland bills a company in Wellington. The total is over $1,000, so the invoice carries every detail IRD asks for at that level. The numbers match the list further down. The names, numbers and bank account are made up.</p>
  <div class="inv" role="img" aria-label="Example New Zealand tax invoice with numbered required details">
    <div class="top">
      <div><div class="ttl">TAX INVOICE<sup>1</sup></div></div>
      <div class="who">
        <strong>Hinemoa Design Ltd</strong><sup>2</sup><br>14 Example Street, Ponsonby, Auckland 1011<br>
        <span class="mut">GST number 000-000-000</span><sup>3</sup>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row2">
      <div style="line-height:1.55"><div class="k">Bill to</div><strong>Kauri Coffee Roasters Ltd</strong><sup>4</sup><br>8 Sample Road, Te Aro, Wellington 6011<sup>4</sup><br><span class="mut">GST number 000-000-001</span><sup>4</sup></div>
      <div class="meta">
        <span class="k">Invoice no.</span><strong>INV-0087</strong>
        <span class="k">Invoice date</span><strong>16 November 2026<sup>5</sup></strong>
        <span class="k">Due date</span><strong>30 November 2026</strong>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="tw"><table>
      <thead><tr><th>Description<sup>6</sup></th><th class="r">Qty</th><th class="r">Price excl. GST</th><th class="r">Amount excl. GST<sup>7</sup></th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Brand identity design: logo and style guide (fixed fee)</td><td class="r">1</td><td class="r">$2,400.00</td><td class="r">$2,400.00</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Website design, hours</td><td class="r">20</td><td class="r">$95.00</td><td class="r">$1,900.00</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
    <div class="sum"><div>
      <div class="sl"><span class="mut">Subtotal excl. GST<sup>7</sup></span><span>$4,300.00</span></div>
      <div class="sl"><span class="mut">GST 15%<sup>8</sup></span><span>$645.00</span></div>
      <div class="sl tot"><span>Total incl. GST (NZD)<sup>9</sup></span><span>$4,945.00</span></div>
    </div></div>
